<title>USA: Del Webb sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Del Webb sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Del Webb Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager, Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER Del Webb Corp</p>
<p>AMT $150 million	 COUPON 9.75 PCT   MATURITY 1/15/08</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SEC NOTES ISS PRICE 99.5    FIRST PAY DATE 7/15/08</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.825 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-minus   SPREAD N/A	  CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
